<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT plans to list 50 mln common shares.</title>
<headline>PLDT plans to list 50 mln common shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT) said on Friday the bourse had allowed it to list 50 million common shares starting January 15.</p>
<p>The shares are to cover the cumulative converted preferred shares to be issued under the Subscriber Investment Plan from January 1 to December 31 this year.</p>
<p>The shares have a par value of 10 pesos per share.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
